     "titulo": "Two-pass revision",
     "texto": [
      "First check the meaning and the order: in a main clause, the conjugated verb goes in second position: **I dag jobber jeg hjemme** («Today I work from home»). Then check letters and punctuation: proper names take a capital letter and questions end with a question mark.",
      "Don't confuse **a, æ, e, ø, å**: changing a vowel can change the word. A final read-aloud can help with rhythm, although the text does not replace a pronunciation model."
     ],
